{{h1}}JSX and TSX

JSX and TSX are code-first component syntaxes, not text-template languages.

- Follow the framework's component, property, state, and escaping conventions.
- Keep domain logic outside rendering expressions and preserve accessibility conventions.
- Validate rendered behaviour with the project's component tooling.

